  <description>
    <p>
      Lucid Spell is a desktop translator powered by large language models.
      Bring your own API key and translate text using OpenAI, Google AI,
      Anthropic, Mistral, OpenRouter, or any custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>LLM-powered translation with automatic source text correction</li>
      <li>High-quality neural text-to-speech via Microsoft Edge TTS</li>
      <li>Personal dictionaries with term pairs, bulk import and export</li>
      <li>Favorites and flashcard study mode</li>
      <li>Configurable keyboard shortcuts</li>
      <li>SOCKS5/HTTP/HTTPS proxy support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
